</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Jesus, I die to Thee,</l><l>Whenever death shall come;</l><l>To die in Thee is life to me,</l><l>With Thee I’m ever one!</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Whether to live or die,</l><l>I know not which is best;</l><l>To live in Thee is bliss to me,</l><l>To die is endless rest.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Living or dying, Lord,</l><l>I ask but to be Thine;</l><l>My life in Thee, Thy life in me,</l><l>Makes Thee forever mine.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
